 "description": "Promotion-gate view: canary vs stable success rate, latency and errors. Istio panels split by workload and work immediately; fm_http panels split by the `variant` label, which only appears on series from pods that rolled with the fm_runtime change that added it \u2014 until the fleet rolls, trust the Istio + Loki panels.",
 "tags": [
  "funnelmanager",
  "canary"
 ],
